    {
      "v": "pasha",
      "t": "Сделаю.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "И не тяни с торговым центром!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So that's Arkady: one face for the crowd, and quite another for his deputy. When you watch, listen for Marina's 'Don't lie', you'll catch it now. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "До свидания!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
